User → Edge Auth → Chat API
  → (fast path) intent LLM → JSON {intent, slots, confidence}
  → Router:
       if intent in [chat, explain]: stream LLM reply
       if intent in [wiki.query, order.create]: call allowlisted handler
       if intent needs multi-step: enqueue Agent job (scoped tools)
  → Worker pulls job → Hermes agent loop (bounded tools) → result
  → Session DB + Audit + SSE back to user

<span class="c"># 不要做</span>
<span class="y">❌</span> 把 hermes proxy 當多用戶 Agent 後台
<span class="y">❌</span> 給公網用戶裸 terminal / 全檔案系統
